# 21. Final Architecture Summary

Your final wrap-up:

> Tinder can be designed using a microservices architecture with a recommendation engine, geospatial indexing, high-throughput swipe processing, Redis caching, Kafka-based event pipelines, distributed NoSQL databases, and WebSocket-based chat infrastructure. The system prioritizes low latency, scalability, recommendation quality, and real-time user engagement while supporting millions of concurrent users globally.

